# Planted bugs in the chosen design. Each one must make Authentication
# miss its declared expectation of verified.
run fv-tamarin challenge.spthy
properties Authentication
file challenge.spthy

mutation the server stops checking that the signature covers the nonce
detects Authentication
-   --[ Eq(verify(sig, ~n, pkA), true), Accept($S, $A, ~n) ]->
+  --[ Eq(verify(sig, 'ok', pkA), true), Accept($S, $A, ~n) ]->

mutation the equality restriction is dropped, so Eq no longer constrains anything
detects Authentication
- restriction Equality:
-   "All x y #i. Eq(x,y) @ i ==> x = y"
+

harmless a rule comment is reworded
- // The client signs the nonce it was sent.
+ // The client signs whatever nonce the In fact carries.
